<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11604" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάτερθε</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[πᾰ</span>], before a vowel <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάσχολ-θεν</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>apart, aloof,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. δὲ θωρήσσοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.587
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				1059
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				7.74
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as Prep.
			c.gen., <i>far away from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάτερθεν ὁμίλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.445
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				1153
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόων ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.2123
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
